attach names [baitas] [x00 x01 x02 x03 x04 x05 x06 x07 x08 x09 x0a x0b x0c x0d x0e x0f x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x18 x19 x1a x1b x1c x1d x1e x1f x20 x21 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x2a x2b x2c x2d x2e x2f x30 x31 x32 x33 x34 x35 x36 x37 x38 x39 x3a x3b x3c x3d x3e x3f x40 x41 x42 x43 x44 x45 x46 x47 x48 x49 x4a x4b x4c x4d x4e x4f x50 x51 x52 x53 x54 x55 x56 x57 x58 x59 x5a x5b x5c x5d x5e x5f x60 x61 x62 x63 x64 x65 x66 x67 x68 x69 x6a x6b x6c x6d x6e x6f x70 x71 x72 x73 x74 x75 x76 x77 x78 x79 x7a x7b x7c x7d x7e x7f x80 x81 x82 x83 x84 x85 x86 x87 x88 x89 x8a x8b x8c x8d x8e x8f x90 x91 x92 x93 x94 x95 x96 x97 x98 x99 x9a x9b x9c x9d x9e x9f xa0 xa1 xa2 xa3 xa4 xa5 xa6 xa7 xa8 xa9 xaa xab xac xad xae xaf xb0 xb1 xb2 xb3 xb4 xb5 xb6 xb7 xb8 xb9 xba xbb xbc xbd xbe xbf xc0 xc1 xc2 xc3 xc4 xc5 xc6 xc7 xc8 xc9 xca xcb xcc xcd xce xcf xd0 xd1 xd2 xd3 xd4 xd5 xd6 xd7 xd8 xd9 xda xdb xdc xdd xde xdf xe0 xe1 xe2 xe3 xe4 xe5 xe6 xe7 xe8 xe9 xea xeb xec xed xee xef xf0 xf1 xf2 xf3 xf4 xf5 xf6 xf7 xf8 xf9 xfa xfb xfc xfd xfe xff
];

attach variables [ reg_s] [ R0 R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 SP PC];
attach variables [ reg_d] [ R0 R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 SP PC];
attach variables [ reg_lo ] [ R1 R1 R3 R3 R5 R5 PC PC];

# next word with data or first opcode
define token data_word (16)
	imm16 = (0,15)
	rell16	=(0,15) signed
;

# THIS HACK. I do not know how to use two imm16, two words of data (4 bytes)
define token data_double_word (32)
	imm32=(0,31)
	imm32H=(16,31)
	rell32h=(16,31) signed
	imm32L=(0,15)
	rell32l=(0,15) signed
;






# Relative addressing. Note x2 multiplication (adressing is in words)
REL8:	reloc	is rell			[reloc = inst_next + 2 * rell;]	{ tmp:2 = 0; tmp=reloc; export  tmp;} 
# relative values from extra bytes.
REL32H:	reloc 	is rell32h  	[reloc = inst_next + rell32h;]	{ tmp:2 = 0; tmp=reloc; export  tmp; } 
REL32L:	reloc 	is rell32l  	[reloc = inst_next + rell32l-2;]	{tmp:2 = 0; tmp=reloc; export  tmp; } 
REL16: reloc is rell16 [reloc = (inst_next + rell16) & 0xffff;] {tmp:2 = 0; tmp=reloc; export tmp;}

RELN:	reloc	is nnn	[reloc = inst_next-nnn*2;]		{tmp:2 = 0; tmp=reloc; export  tmp; } 

# ############# SIMPLE INSTRUCTIONS #################################### 
:MFPT		is imm16=0x07	{R0=R0;}
:EMHALT		is imm16=0x08	{R0=R0;}
:start0		is imm16=0x09	{R0=R0;}
:start1		is imm16=0x0a	{R0=R0;}
:start2		is imm16=0x0b	{R0=R0;}
:step0		is imm16=0x0c	{R0=R0;}
:step1		is imm16=0x0d	{R0=R0;}
:step2		is imm16=0x0e	{R0=R0;}
:step3		is imm16=0x0f	{R0=R0;}

:NOP		is imm16=0x0A0	{R0=R0;}
:HALT		is imm16=0		{tmp:2=0x28; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x2A; PS=*:2 tmp; goto [PC];}
:WAIT		is imm16=1		{PC=PC-2; goto [PC];}
:CLC		is imm16=0x0A1	{C=0;}
:CLV		is imm16=0x0A2	{V=0;}
:CLVC		is imm16=0x0A3	{C=0;V=0;}
:CLZ		is imm16=0x0A4	{Z=0;}
:CLZC		is imm16=0x0A5	{Z=0;C=0;}
:CLZV		is imm16=0x0A6	{Z=0;V=0;}
:CLZVC		is imm16=0x0A7	{Z=0;V=0;C=0;}
:CLN		is imm16=0x0A8	{N=0;}
:CCC		is imm16=0x0AF	{C=0;V=0;Z=0;N=0;}
:nop2		is imm16=0x0b0	{C=C;}
:SEC		is imm16=0x0b1	{C=1;}
:SEV		is imm16=0x0b2	{V=1;}
:SEVC		is imm16=0x0b3	{V=1;C=1;}
:SEZ		is imm16=0x0b4	{Z=1;}
:SEZC		is imm16=0x0b5	{Z=1;C=1;}
:SEZV		is imm16=0x0b6	{Z=1;V=1;}
:SEZVC		is imm16=0x0b7	{Z=1;C=1;V=1;}

:SEN		is imm16=0x0b8	{N=1;}
:SENC		is imm16=0x0b9	{N=1;C=1;}
:SENV		is imm16=0x0ba	{N=1;V=1;}
:SENVC		is imm16=0x0bb	{N=1;V=1;C=1;}
:SENZ		is imm16=0x0bc	{N=1;Z=1;}
:SENZC		is imm16=0x0bd	{N=1;Z=1;C=1;}
:SENZV		is imm16=0x0be	{N=1;V=1;Z=1;}

:CSM		is imm16=0xe40	{PC=PC;}

:SCC		is imm16=0x0bF {C=1;V=1;Z=1;N=1;}
:RESET		is imm16=0x005	{SP=SP;}

################ ILLEGAL INSTRUCTIONS ####################
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=2	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=3	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=4	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=5	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=6	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=0 & metod=7	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}

:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=2 & metod=1	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=2 & metod=2	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
#:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas=2 & metod=3	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas_s=0 & met_s=7	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}

:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas_s=7 & met_s=5	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas_s=7 & met_s=6	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas_s=8 & met_s=7	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}
:ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION is kodas_s=0xF			{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0A; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x08; call [tmp];}


################ BRANCHES ################################

:BR   REL8			is op_h=1 & REL8	{goto [REL8];}
:BNE  REL8			is op_h=2 & REL8	{if Z	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # Z=0
:BEQ  REL8			is op_h=3 & REL8	{if !Z	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # Z=1
:BPL  REL8			is op_h=0x80 & REL8 {if N	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # N=0 sign
:BMI  REL8			is op_h=0x81 & REL8 {if !N	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # N=1
:BVC  REL8			is op_h=0x84 & REL8 {if V	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # V=0 overflow
:BVS  REL8			is op_h=0x85 & REL8 {if !V	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # V=1
:BCC  REL8			is op_h=0x86 & REL8 {if C	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # C=0 carry
:BCS  REL8			is op_h=0x87 & REL8 {if !C	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # C=1
:BGE  REL8			is op_h=4 & REL8	{if (N ^ V)		goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # N xor V =0
:BLT  REL8			is op_h=5 & REL8	{if !(N ^ V)	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # N xor V =1
:BGT  REL8			is op_h=6 & REL8	{if ((N ^ V)|Z)	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # (N xor V) or Z =0
:BLE  REL8			is op_h=7 & REL8	{if !((N ^ V)|Z)goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # (N xor V) or Z =0
:BHI  REL8			is op_h=0x82 & REL8 {if !(!C & !Z)	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # C and Z =0
:BLOS REL8			is op_h=0x83 & REL8 {if !(C | Z)	goto inst_next; goto [REL8];} # C or Z =1

####################### VARIANTAI adresacijos #############################################

# adresacijos metodai (mode)? arba
# 0 - registras Rn ; =R
# 1 - netiesioginis registras @Rn arba (Rn) - viduje registro reiksme; =peek(R)
# 2 - autoinkrementinis (Rn)+ ; =peek(R), R=R+1
# 3 - @(Rn)+
# 4 - -(Rn)
# 5 - @-(Rn)
# 6 - indeksinis X(Rn)
# 7 - @X(Rn)

# SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE SOURCE

# MODE0: Operand is in the register
# operand = Rn
OPS: reg_s" OK0a"			is met_s=0 & reg_ss=7 & reg_s{tmp:2 =  reg_s+2; export tmp;} # Tested in hardware: PC reg contains NEXT adr
OPS: reg_s" OK0b"			is met_s=0 & reg_ss!=7 & reg_s{tmp:2 =  reg_s; export tmp;}

# MODE1:(register deferred)
# Register contains the address of the operand
# EA = Rn
# operand = MEM[EA]

OPS: "("reg_s") OK1"		is met_s=1 & reg_s {tmp:2 =0; tmp=*:2 reg_s; export tmp;}

# MODE2: (autoincrement)
# EA = Rn
# operand = MEM[EA]
# Rn = Rn + (is_byte ? 1 : 2)
OPS: "("reg_s")+ OK2a"		is byte=1 & met_s=2 & reg_s				{tmp:2=reg_s; reg_s=reg_s+1; export *:2 tmp; }
OPS: "("reg_s")+ OK2b"		is byte=0 & met_s=2 & reg_s				{tmp:2=reg_s; reg_s=reg_s+2; export *:2 tmp; }
OPS: "#"imm16" OK2c"		is byte=0 & met_s=2 & reg_s=7 ;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16; export tmp;}

 #{tmp:2 = inst_start + 2; export tmp;}
 #{tmp:2 = imm16; export *[const]:2 tmp;}
 #{ export *[const]:2 immval; }
 #blabla: "#"^immval		is immed8 [ immval = immed8 * 4; ]		{ export *[const]:4 immval; }
 ## don't export as an address, may be PIC code, and would add spurious symbols.
 # export *[const]:2 reloc;
 
OPS: "#"imm16" OK2d"  		is byte=1 & met_s=2 & reg_s=7						;imm16 {tmp:2=imm16; export tmp;}
OPS: "#"imm32L"OK2e"		is byte=0 & met_s=2 & reg_s=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7	;imm32L {tmp:2 = imm32L; export tmp;}

# MODE3: (autoincrement deferred)
# EA_ptr = Rn
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
# Rn = Rn + 2

OPS: "@("reg_s")+ OK3a"		is met_s=3& reg_ss!=7 & (met_d=0 | met_d=1 | met_d=4 | met_d=5)		& reg_s		{tmp:2 = *:2 reg_s; tmp2=*:2 tmp; reg_s=reg_s+2; export tmp2;}
OPS: "@("reg_s")+ OK3b"		is met_s=3& reg_ss!=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) & reg_d!=7        		& reg_s		{tmp:2 = *:2 reg_s; tmp2=*:2 tmp; reg_s=reg_s+2; export tmp2;}
OPS: "@("reg_s")+ OK3c"		is met_s=3& reg_ss!=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) & reg_d=7				& reg_s		{tmp:2 = *:2 reg_s; tmp2=*:2 tmp; reg_s=reg_s+2; export tmp2;}
OPS: "@("reg_s")+ OK3d"		is met_s=3& reg_ss!=7 & (met_d=6 | met_d=7)							& reg_s		{tmp:2 = *:2 reg_s; tmp2=*:2 tmp; reg_s=reg_s+2; export tmp2;}
OPS: "@#"imm16" OK3e"		is met_s=3&  reg_ss=7 & (met_d=0 | met_d=1 | met_d=4 | met_d=5)		;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16;  export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@#"imm16" OK3f"  		is met_s=3 & reg_ss=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) & reg_d!=7 				;imm16  {tmp:2 = imm16;  export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@#"imm32L" OK3g"		is met_s=3&  reg_ss=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) & reg_d=7				;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@#"imm32L" OK3h"		is met_s=3&  reg_ss=7 & (met_d=6 | met_d=7)							;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE4: (autodecrement)
# Rn = Rn - (is_byte ? 1 : 2)
# EA = Rn
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPS: "-("reg_s") OK4a"		is byte=1 & met_s=4 & reg_s {reg_s=reg_s-1; export *:2 reg_s;}
OPS: "-("reg_s") OK4b"		is byte=0 & met_s=4 & reg_s {reg_s=reg_s-2; export *:2 reg_s;}

# MODE5: (autodecrement deferred)
# Rn = Rn - 2
# EA_ptr = Rn
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPS: "@-("reg_s")_OK5a"		is met_s=5 & reg_s {reg_s=reg_s-2; tmp:2 = *:2 reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE6: (index)
# EA = Rn + offset
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPS: imm16"("reg_s")_OK6a"	is met_s=6 & reg_s									;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16 + reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}

OPS: REL16"_OK6b"			is met_s=6 & reg_s=7								;REL16	{export  *:2 REL16;}

#OPS: REL16"_OK6b"			is met_s=6 & reg_ss=7	& reg_s							;REL16 & imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
# ^^--nerodo label


OPS: REL32L"_OK6c"			is met_s=6 & met_d=6 & reg_s=7						;REL32L	{tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: REL32L"_OK6d"			is met_s=6 & met_d=7 & reg_s=7						;REL32L	{tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: imm32L"("reg_s")_OK6e"	is met_s=6 & met_d=6 & reg_s						;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: imm32L"("reg_s")_OK6f"	is met_s=6 & met_d=7 & reg_s						;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: REL32L"_OK6g"			is met_s=6 & met_d=3 & reg_s=7						;REL32L	{tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: imm32L"("reg_s")_OK6h"	is met_s=6 & met_d=3 & reg_d=7 & reg_ss!=7 &reg_s	;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: REL32L"_OK6j" is met_s=6 & reg_s=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7 					;REL32L {tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE7: (index deferred)
# EA_ptr = Rn + offset
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPS: "@"imm16"("reg_s")7a" 		is met_s=7 & (met_d=0 | met_d=1 | met_d=4 | met_d=5) & reg_ss!=7	& reg_s	;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@"REL16" 7f" 				is met_s=7 & (met_d=0 | met_d=1 | met_d=4 | met_d=5) & reg_ss=7		& reg_s	;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@"REL16"("reg_s")7b"		is met_s=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) &reg_d!=7							& reg_s ;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@"REL32L"?OK7c"			is met_s=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) &reg_d=7	& reg_s=7						;REL32L	{tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@"imm16"("reg_s") OK7cc"	is met_s=7 & (met_d=2 | met_d=3) &reg_d=7	& reg_ss!=7				&reg_s 	;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_s; tmp2:2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
OPS: "@"imm32L"?OK7d"			is met_s=7 &         (met_d=6 | met_d=7)	& reg_ss!=7				&reg_s	;imm32L	{tmp:2 = imm32L+reg_s; export *:2 tmp;}
OPS: "@"REL32L"?OK7e"			is met_s=7 &         (met_d=6 | met_d=7)	& reg_s=7						;REL32L	{tmp:2 = REL32L; export *:2 tmp;}

# DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION DESTINATION
# MODE0:
OPD: reg_d" OK0"		is met_d=0 & reg_d	{export reg_d;}
OPDD: reg_d" OK0"		is met_d=0 & reg_d	{export reg_d;}

# MODE1:
OPD: "("reg_d") OK1"	is met_d=1 & reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}
OPDD: "("reg_d") OK1"	is met_d=1 & reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE2: (autoincrement)
# EA = Rn
# operand = MEM[EA]
# Rn = Rn + (is_byte ? 1 : 2)

OPD: "("reg_d")+ OK2a"		is byte=1 &met_d=2 & reg_dd!=7 &reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+1; export *:2 tmp; }
OPD: "("reg_d")+ OK2b"		is byte=0 &met_d=2 & reg_dd!=7 &reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp; }

OPDD: "("reg_d")+ OK2a"		is byte=1 &met_d=2 & reg_dd!=7 &reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+1; export *:2 tmp; }
OPDD: "("reg_d")+ OK2b"		is byte=0 &met_d=2 & reg_dd!=7 &reg_d	{tmp:2=reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp; }
OPDD: "#"imm16" OK2c" is byte=0 & met_d=2 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d ;imm16 {tmp:2 = imm16; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}
OPDD: "#"imm16" OK2d" is byte=1 & met_d=2 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d ;imm16 {tmp:2 = imm16; reg_d=reg_d+1; export tmp;}

# kaip su nekorektiskom PC (R7) operacijom?
OPD: "#"imm16" OK2e"	is byte=0 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7 & reg_d	;imm16 {tmp:2 = imm16; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm16" OK2f"	is byte=1 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7 & reg_d	;imm16 {tmp:2 = imm16; reg_d=reg_d+1; export tmp;}

OPD: "#"imm32H"OK2g"	is byte=0 & met_s=2 & reg_s=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; PC=PC+2; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm32H"OK2h"	is byte=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; PC=PC+2; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm32H"OK2i"	is byte=1 & met_s=2 & reg_s=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; PC=PC+1; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm32H"OK2j"	is byte=1 & met_s=6 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; PC=PC+1; export tmp;}

OPD: "#"imm32H"OK2k" 	is met_d=2 & reg_s=7 & reg_d=7;imm32H			{tmp:2 = imm32H; PC=PC+2; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm16"OK2l" 	is met_d=2 & met_s=0 & reg_s=7 & reg_d=7;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16; PC=PC+2; export tmp;}

OPD: "#"imm32H" OK2m"	is byte=0 & met_s=7 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7 & reg_d	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}
OPD: "#"imm32H" OK2n"	is byte=1 & met_s=7 &reg_s!=7 & met_d=2 & reg_d=7 & reg_d	;imm32H {tmp:2 = imm32H; reg_d=reg_d+1; export tmp;}


# MODE3: (autoincrement deferred)
# EA_ptr = Rn
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
# Rn = Rn + 2
OPD: "@("reg_d")+ OK3a"		is met_d=3& reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_d 		{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@("reg_d")+ OK3b"		is met_d=3& reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) & reg_s!=7 & reg_d 					{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@("reg_d")+ OK3c"		is met_d=3& reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) & reg_s=7 & reg_d 					{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@("reg_d")+ OK3d"		is met_d=3& reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d 							{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@#"imm16" OK3e"		is met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_d	;imm16	{tmp:2 =imm16; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@#"imm16"_OK3f"		is met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &   reg_s!=7 & reg_d		;imm16	{tmp:2=imm16; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@#"imm32H" OK3g"		is met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &   reg_s=7  & reg_d		;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@#"imm32H" OK3h"		is met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d=7					;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H; export *:2 tmp;}
#OPD: "@#"imm16" OK3i"		is kodas_s!=1 & met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d=7		;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@#"imm32H" OK3i"		is kodas_s!=1 & met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & (met_s=6 | met_s=7)				;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H; export *:2 tmp;}


OPDD: "@("reg_d")+ OK3a"	is met_d=3& reg_dd!=7 & reg_d 			{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export *:2 tmp;}
OPDD: "@#"imm16" OK3e"		is met_d=3&  reg_dd=7 & reg_d	;imm16	{tmp:2 =imm16; export *:2 tmp;}


# MODE4: (autodecrement)
# Rn = Rn - (is_byte ? 1 : 2)
# EA = Rn
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPD: "-("reg_d") OK4a"	is byte=1 & met_d=4 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-1; tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "-("reg_d") OK4b"	is byte=0 & met_d=4 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-2; tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}

OPDD: "-("reg_d") OK4a"	is byte=1 & met_d=4 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-1; tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}
OPDD: "-("reg_d") OK4b"	is byte=0 & met_d=4 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-2; tmp:2=reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE5: (autodecrement deferred)
# Rn = Rn - 2
# EA_ptr = Rn
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPD: "@-("reg_d") OK5a"	is met_d=5 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-2; tmp:2 = *:2 reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}
OPDD: "@-("reg_d") OK5a"	is met_d=5 & reg_d 	{reg_d=reg_d-2; tmp:2 = *:2 reg_d; export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE6: (index)
# EA = Rn + offset
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPD: imm16"("reg_d") OK6a"	is met_d=6 & reg_d							;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d;	export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: REL16" OK6b"			is met_d=6 & reg_d=7						;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16;			export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: REL32H" OK6i" 			is met_d=6 & met_s=2 & reg_d=7 & reg_s=7	;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H;		export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: REL32H" OK6c"			is met_d=6 & met_s=6 & reg_d=7				;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H;		export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: REL32H" OK6d"			is met_d=6 & met_s=7 & reg_d=7				;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H;		export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: imm32H"("reg_d") OK6e"	is met_d=6 & met_s=6 & reg_d				;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d;	export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: imm32H"("reg_d")?OK6f"	is met_d=6 & met_s=7 & reg_d				;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d;	export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: REL32H" OK6g"			is met_d=6 & met_s=3 & reg_d=7				;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H;		export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: imm32H(reg_d)"_OK6h"	is met_d=6 & (met_s=3 | met_s=2) & reg_s=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d	;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d;		export *:2 tmp;}

OPDD: imm16"("reg_d") OK6aa"	is met_d=6 & reg_d						;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d;	export *:2 tmp;}
OPDD: REL16" OK6bb"				is met_d=6 & reg_d=7					;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16;			export  *:2 tmp;}

#OPDD: REL16" OK6bb"			is met_d=6 & reg_d=7				;REL16 & imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d;	export *:2 tmp;}

# MODE7: (index deferred)
# EA_ptr = Rn + offset
# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]




# EA = MEM[EA_ptr]
# operand = MEM[EA]
OPD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7a" 	is met_d=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d	;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
OPD: "@"REL16" ok7f" 		is met_d=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_dd=7 & reg_d		;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}

OPD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7b"	is met_d=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) & reg_s!=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d				;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
OPD: "@"REL16" ok7g"		is met_d=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) & reg_s!=7 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d				;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}

OPD: "@"REL32H"?OK7c"		is met_d=7 & reg_dd=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &reg_s=7 & reg_d				;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H; export *:2 tmp;}
OPD: "@"imm32H"("reg_d") OK7cc"	is met_d=7 & reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &reg_s=7 & reg_d			;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}

OPD: "@"imm32H"("reg_d")?OK7d"	is met_d=7 & (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_dd!=7 &reg_d						;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d; tmp2:2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
OPD: "@"REL32H"?OK7e"		is met_d=7 &         (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d=7							;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H; export *:2 tmp;}




OPDD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7z" is met_d=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d		;imm16		{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
OPDD: "@"REL16" ok7f" 		is met_d=7 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d			;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}


#OPD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7a" 	is met_d=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d	;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
#OPD: "@"REL16" ok7f" 		is met_d=7 & (met_s=0 | met_s=1 | met_s=4 | met_s=5) & reg_dd=7 & reg_d			;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}
##OPD: "@"REL16"("reg_d")7b"	is met_d=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &reg_s!=7 & reg_d 							;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}
#OPD: "@"REL32H"?OK7c"		is met_d=7 & reg_d & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &reg_s=7								;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H; export *:2 tmp;}
#OPD: "@"imm32H"("reg_d") OK7cc"	is met_d=7 & reg_dd!=7 & (met_s=2 | met_s=3) &reg_s=7 & reg_d			;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp;	export *:2 tmp2;}
#OPD: "@"imm32H"?OK7d"		is met_d=7 &         (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d!=7								;imm32H	{tmp:2 = imm32H; tmp2=*:2 tmp;			export *:2 tmp2;}
#OPD: "@"REL32H"?OK7e"		is met_d=7 &         (met_s=6 | met_s=7) & reg_d=7								;REL32H	{tmp:2 = REL32H;						export *:2 tmp;}

#OPDD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7z" is met_d=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d			;imm16	{tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
#OPDD: "@"REL16" ok7f" 		is met_d=7 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d			;REL16	{tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}


#OPD: "@"imm16"("reg_d")7b" is met_d=7 & (met_s=2|met_s=3) & reg_s!=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d ;imm16 {tmp:2 = imm16+reg_d; tmp2:2=*:2 tmp; export *:2 tmp2;}
#OPD: "@"REL16" ok7g" is met_d=7 & (met_s=2|met_s=3) & reg_s!=7 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d ;REL16 {tmp:2 = REL16; export *:2 tmp;}



######### XOR SOB MUL DIV ASH ASHC - too complicated to understand ###################################
:XOR reg_s,OPD	is (kodas_s=7 &met_s=4 & reg_s) ...& OPD {OPD=OPD^reg_s; FLZ(OPD);FLN(OPD);V=0;}
:SOB reg_s,RELN	is kodas_s=7 &met_s=7 & reg_s & RELN &nnn {reg_s=reg_s-1;if (reg_s==0) goto inst_next;goto [RELN];} # SOB RRR,NNN NNN : R := R – 1; IF (R != 0) THEN PC := PC – 2 * NN

:MUL OPD,reg_s  is (kodas_s=7 & met_s=0 & reg_s & reg_lo) ... & OPD  { ### kodel susikeite OPD ir OPS?
    prod:4 = sext(reg_s) * sext(OPD);
#	tmp = reg_s;
    reg_s  = prod(2);                 # high 16 bits -> R
    reg_lo = prod(0);                 # low  16 bits -> R+1
    Z = (prod == 0);
    N = (prod s< 0);
    V = 0;
    C = (prod s< -32768) || (prod s> 32767);
#	if (tmp != 7) goto <exxx>;
#	goto [PC];
#	<exxx>
}

:DIV OPD,reg_s  is (kodas_s=7 & met_s=1 & reg_s & reg_lo) ... & OPD  {
build OPD;
    dividend:4 = (zext(reg_s) << 16) | zext(reg_lo);
    divisor:4  = sext(OPD);
    if (divisor != 0) goto <ok>;
        V = 1; C = 1;                 # divide by zero: abort, per J11
        goto <done>;
    <ok>
    quot:4 = dividend s/ divisor;
    rem:4  = dividend s% divisor;
    reg_s  = quot(0);                 # quotient  -> R
    reg_lo = rem(0);                  # remainder -> R+1
    N = (quot s< 0);
    Z = (quot == 0);
    V = 0;
    C = 0;
    <done>
}

:ASH OPD,reg_s	is (kodas_s=7 &met_s=2 & reg_s) ...& OPD {
build OPD;
cnt:2 = OPD & 0x3F;
old:2 = reg_s;
mag:2 = 0;
if (cnt==0) goto <zero>;
if ((cnt & 0x20)!=0) goto <right>;

mag = cnt;
C = (((old << (mag-1)) & 0x8000)!=0);
reg_s = reg_s << mag;
goto <done>;

<right>
mag = (0x40 - cnt) & 0x3F;
C = (((old s>> (mag-1)) & 1)!=0);
reg_s = reg_s s>> mag;
goto <done>;

<zero>
V=0;
goto <flags>;

<done>
V = (((old ^ reg_s) & 0x8000)!=0);

<flags>
FLN(reg_s); FLZ(reg_s);
}


:ASHC OPD,reg_s	is (kodas_s=7 & met_s=3 & reg_s & reg_lo & reg_ss) ... & OPD {
build OPD;
cnt:2 = OPD & 0x3F;
mag:2 = 0;
rot:2 = 0;
cbit:2 = 0;
old:4 = (zext(reg_s)<<16) | zext(reg_lo);
comb:4 = old;
oldw:2 = reg_s;
oddreg:2 = reg_ss;

if (cnt==0) goto <zero>;
if ((cnt & 0x20)!=0) goto <right>;

# ---- LEFT shift: normal 32-bit arithmetic shift ----
mag = cnt;
C = (((old << (mag-1)) & 0x80000000)!=0);
comb = old << mag;
goto <finish32>;

<right>
mag = (0x40 - cnt) & 0x3F;
if ((oddreg & 1)!=0) goto <right_odd>;

# ---- RIGHT shift, even register pair: normal 32-bit arithmetic shift ----
C = (((old s>> (mag-1)) & 1)!=0);
comb = old s>> mag;
goto <finish32>;

<right_odd>
# ---- RIGHT shift, odd register: becomes a 16-bit rotate of that single register ----
rot = mag & 0xF;
cbit = (mag-1) & 0xF;
C = (((oldw >> cbit) & 1)!=0);
reg_s = (oldw >> rot) | (oldw << (16-rot));
N = (reg_s s< 0);
Z = (reg_s == 0);
V = (((oldw ^ reg_s) & 0x8000)!=0);
goto <end>;

<zero>
N = (old s< 0);
Z = (old == 0);
V = 0;
goto <end>;

<finish32>
reg_s  = comb(2);
reg_lo = comb(0);
N = (comb s< 0);
Z = (comb == 0);
V = (((old ^ comb) & 0x80000000)!=0);

<end>
}
##################################################################################

# ############ DOUBLE OPS & OPD ########################

:MOV OPS,OPD	is (kodas_s=0x1 & reg_dd & met_d)...& OPS & OPD {build OPS;build OPD;N=((OPS & 0x8000)!=0);FLZ(OPS); OPD = OPS; V=0; PCFIX(OPD:2,reg_dd:1,met_d:1);}
:MOVB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x9 & met_d=0)...  & OPD & OPS	{build OPS;build OPD;OPD=sext(OPS[0,8]); FLZ(OPS&0xFF); N=((OPS&0x80)!=0); V=0;}
#:MOVB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x9 & met_d!=0)... & OPD & OPS	{build OPS;build OPD;OPD=(OPD&0xFF00)|(OPS&0xFF); FLZ(OPS&0xFF); N=((OPS&0x80)!=0); V=0;}
:MOVB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x9 & met_d!=0)... & OPD & OPS	{build OPS;build OPD;OPD[0,8]=OPS[0,8]; FLZ(OPS&0xFF); N=((OPS&0x80)!=0); V=0;}

:CMP OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x2)... & OPD & OPS				{build OPS;build OPD;CMP_FLAGS(OPS,OPD);}
:CMPB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0xA)... & OPD & OPS				{build OPS;build OPD;CMP_FLAGS(OPS<<8,OPD<<8); Z=((OPD&0xFF)==(OPS&0xFF));}
:SUB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0xE)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;SUB_FLAGS(OPS,OPD); OPD=OPD-OPS;FLN(OPD);}
:ADD OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x6)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;ADD_FLAGS(OPS,OPD);OPD=OPD+OPS;FLN(OPD);}
:BIT OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x3)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;tmp:2=OPS&OPD;FLN(tmp);FLZ(tmp);V=0;}
:BITB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0xB)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;tmp:2=OPS&OPD;FLN(tmp<<8);FLZ(tmp&0xFF);V=0;}
:BIC OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x4)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;OPD=(~OPS) & OPD;FLZ(OPD);FLN(OPD); V=0;} #bit clear dst=not(src) and (dst)
:BICB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0xC)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;tmp=OPD&0xFF00;OPD=((~OPS)&(OPD&0xFF))|tmp;FLZ(OPD&0x00FF);FLN(OPD<<8); V=0;}
:BIS OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0x5)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;OPD=OPD | OPS; FLN(OPD);FLZ(OPD);V=0;}
:BISB OPS,OPD 	is (kodas_s=0xD)... & OPS & OPD				{build OPS;build OPD;OPD=OPD | (OPS&0xFF); FLN(OPD);FLZ(OPD);V=0;}

# ############ SINGLE DDDD #############################

:CLR OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=0)... &OPDD	{OPDD=0; N=0; Z=1; V=0; C=0;}
:CLRB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=0)... &OPDD	{OPDD=OPDD & 0xFF00; N=0; Z=1; V=0; C=0;}
:COM OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=1)... &OPDD	{OPDD=~OPDD; FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD); V=0; C=1;}
:COMB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=1)... &OPDD	{tmp1:2 =OPDD & 0xFF00;tmp2:2 =(~OPDD) & 0x00FF;FLZ(tmp2);OPDD=tmp1|tmp2;FLN(OPDD<<8);V=0;C=1;}
:INC OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=2)... &OPDD	{V=(OPDD==0x7FFF);OPDD=OPDD+1; FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD);}
:INCB OPDD 		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=2)... &OPDD	{V=((OPDD&0xFF)==0x7F);tmp=OPDD & 0xFF00; OPDD=((OPDD+1)&0x00FF)|tmp; FLZ(OPDD & 0x00FF); FLN(OPDD<<8);}
:DEC OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=3)... &OPDD	{V=(OPDD==0x8000);OPDD=OPDD-1;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD);}
:DECB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=3)... &OPDD	{tmp0:2=OPDD&0xFF00;OPDD=OPDD&0xFF;V=(OPDD==0x80);OPDD=(OPDD-1)&0xFF;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD<<8);OPDD=OPDD|tmp0;}
:NEG OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=4)... &OPDD	{OPDD=-OPDD; FLZ(OPDD); V=(OPDD==0x8000); FLN(OPDD); C=(OPDD!=0);}
:NEGB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=4)... &OPDD	{tmp0=OPDD&0xFF00;OPDD=(0-OPDD)&0xFF;V=(OPDD==0x80);FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD<<8);C=(OPDD!=0);OPDD=OPDD|tmp0;}
:ADC OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=5)... &OPDD	{tmp:2=OPDD+(PS&1);V=1;if((OPDD==0x7FFF)&((PS&1)==1))goto<a>;V=0;<a>C=1;if((OPDD==0xFFFF)&((PS&1)==1))goto<b>;C=0;<b>OPDD=tmp;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD);}
:ADCB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=5)... &OPDD	{tmp0:2=OPDD&0xFF00;tmp:2=(OPDD&0xFF)+(PS&1);V=1;OPDD=OPDD&0xFF;if((OPDD==0x7F)&((PS&1)==1))goto<a>;V=0;<a>C=1;if((OPDD==0xFF)&((PS&1)==1))goto<b>;C=0;<b>OPDD=tmp;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD<<8);OPDD=OPDD|tmp0;}
:SBC OPDD 		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=6)... &OPDD	{tmp=OPDD-(PS&1);V=((OPDD==0x8000)&((PS&1)==1));C=((OPDD==0)&((PS&1)==1));OPDD=tmp;FLN(OPDD);FLZ(OPDD);}
:SBCB OPDD 		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=6)... &OPDD	{tmp0=OPDD&0xFF00;OPDD=OPDD&0xFF;tmp=OPDD-(PS&1);V=((OPDD==0x80)&((PS&1)==1));C=((OPDD==0)&((PS&1)==1));OPDD=tmp;FLN(OPDD<<8);FLZ(OPDD);OPDD=OPDD|tmp0;}
:ROR OPDD  		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s=0)... &OPDD	{oldbit0:2=OPDD & 1; OPDD=(OPDD>>1)|(zext(C)<<15); C=(oldbit0==1); FLZ(OPDD); FLN(OPDD); V_NZ();}
:RORB OPDD 		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 &reg_s=0)... &OPDD	{hibyte:2=OPDD&0xFF00; oldbit0:2=OPDD&1; OPDD=((OPDD&0xFF)>>1)|(zext(C)<<7)|hibyte; C=(oldbit0==1); FLZ(OPDD&0xFF); FLN(OPDD<<8); V_NZ();}
:ROL OPDD  		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s=1)... &OPDD	{oldbit15:2=OPDD&0x8000; OPDD=(OPDD<<1)|zext(C); C=(oldbit15!=0); FLZ(OPDD); FLN(OPDD); V_NZ();}
:ROLB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 &reg_s=1)... &OPDD	{tmp0:2=OPDD&0xFF00;tmp1=0x0000;if !(C) goto <nocarry>;tmp1=0x0001;<nocarry>C=(OPDD&0x80)==0x80;OPDD=OPDD<<1;OPDD=OPDD&0xFF;OPDD=OPDD|tmp0|tmp1;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD<<8);V_NZ();}
:ASR OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s=2)... &OPDD	{tmp:2=OPDD & 0x8000;C=(OPDD & 1)==1;OPDD=(OPDD>>1) | tmp;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD);V_NZ();}
:ASRB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 &reg_s=2)... &OPDD	{tmp1:2=OPDD & 0xFF80;tmp2:2=OPDD & 0x00FF;C = (tmp2 & 1)==1;tmp2=tmp2>>1;OPDD=tmp1|tmp2;FLZ(OPDD&0x00FF);FLN(OPDD<<8);V_NZ();}
:ASL OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s=3)... &OPDD	{C=(OPDD & 0x8000)!=0;OPDD=OPDD<<1;FLZ(OPDD); FLN(OPDD); V_NZ();}
:ASLB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 &reg_s=3)... &OPDD	{C=(OPDD & 0x0080)!=0;tmp=OPDD&0xFF00;OPDD=(OPDD&0x007F)<<1;FLZ(OPDD);FLN(OPDD<<8); V_NZ();OPDD=OPDD|tmp;}
:TST OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=5 &reg_s=7)... &OPDD	{FLZ(OPDD); V=0; C=0; FLN(OPDD);}
:TSTB OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=5 &reg_s=7)... &OPDD	{FLZ(OPDD & 0x00FF); V=0; C=0; FLN(OPDD<<8);}
:SXT OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=6 &reg_s=7)... &OPDD	{tmp=0xFFFF;if (N) goto <b>;tmp=0;<b>OPDD=tmp;}
:SWAB OPDD		is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=0 &reg_s=3)... &OPDD	{tmp=OPDD>>8; OPDD=(OPDD<<8)|tmp;FLN(OPDD<<8);FLZ(OPDD&0xFF);V=0;C=0;}
:MFPS OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 & reg_s=7 & met_d=0)... &OPDD	{tmp=sext(PS[0,8]);OPDD=PS&0xFF|tmp;FLZ(OPDD&0xFF);V=0;N=((OPDD&0x80)==0x80);}
:MFPS OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 & reg_s=7 & met_d!=0)... &OPDD	{OPDD=(OPDD&0xFF00)|(PS&0xFF);FLZ(PS&0xFF);V=0;N=((PS&0x80)==0x80);}
:MTPS OPDD		is (kodas_s=8 & met_s=6 & reg_s=4)... &OPDD				{PS=(PS&0xFF10)|(OPDD&0xEF);}

############################ JMP/CALL/JSR ################################################################
# Jumpai (PC registras, R7)
#          543210
# 2 - #X   010 111 = 17
# 3 - @#X  011 111 = 1f
# 6 - X    110 111 = 37
# 7 - @X   111 111 = 3f

OPJ: reg_d" okJ0"			is met_d=0 & reg_d						{export reg_d;}
OPJ: reg_d" okJ1"        	is met_d=1 & reg_d						{export reg_d;}										# mode 1 (Rn): EA=Rn, zero deref
OPJ: reg_d" okJ1pc" is met_d=1 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d {tmp:2=inst_next; export tmp;}
OPJ: "("reg_d")+ okJ2"   	is met_d=2 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d			{tmp:2=reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}			# mode 2 (Rn)+: EA=Rn (pre-increment value), zero deref
OPJ: "#"imm16" okJ2i"    	is met_d=2 & reg_dd=7 & reg_d ;imm16	{tmp:2=imm16; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}			# mode 2, reg=PC: "JMP #imm" -> EA=imm16 literally
OPJ: "@("reg_d")+ okJ3"  	is met_d=3 & reg_d						{tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; reg_d=reg_d+2; export tmp;}		# mode 3 @(Rn)+: EA=MEM[Rn], one deref (intrinsic)
OPJ: "@#"imm16" okJ3pc" 	is met_d=3 & reg_d=7; imm16 		{tmp:2=imm16; export tmp;}
OPJ: "-("reg_d") okJ4"   	is met_d=4 & reg_d						{reg_d=reg_d-2; export reg_d;}						# mode 4 -(Rn): EA=Rn (post-decrement), zero deref
OPJ: "@-("reg_d") okJ5"  	is met_d=5 & reg_d						{reg_d=reg_d-2; tmp:2=*:2 reg_d; export tmp;}		# mode 5 @-(Rn): EA=MEM[Rn], one deref (intrinsic)
OPJ: imm16"("reg_d") okJ6"	is met_d=6 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d ;imm16	{tmp:2=imm16+reg_d; export tmp;}					# mode 6 X(Rn): EA=Rn+X, zero deref
OPJ: REL16" okJ6r"       	is met_d=6 & reg_d=7 ;REL16				{tmp:2=REL16; export tmp;}							# mode 6, reg=PC: "JMP label" -> EA=resolved address directly
OPJ: "@"imm16"("reg_d") okJ7" is met_d=7 & reg_dd!=7 & reg_d ;imm16	{tmp:2=imm16+reg_d; tmp2:2=*:2 tmp; export tmp2;}	# mode 7 @X(Rn): EA=MEM[Rn+X], one deref (intrinsic)
OPJ: "@"REL16" okJ7r"    	is met_d=7 & reg_d=7 ;REL16				{tmp:2=REL16; tmp2:2=*:2 tmp; export tmp2;}			# mode 7, reg=PC: "JMP @label" -> EA=MEM[resolved address]

:JSR reg_s,OPJ is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=4 & reg_s) ... & OPJ	{tmp:2=OPJ;push(reg_s);reg_s=inst_next;call[tmp];}
:CALL OPJ is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=4 & reg_s=7) ... & OPJ		{tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp);call[OPJ];}
:JMP OPJ       is (kodas_s=0 & met_s=0 & reg_s=1)... & OPJ {PC=OPJ; goto[PC];}

############################ RETURN ##########################################
:RETURN		is imm16=0x87 {pop(PC);return [PC];}
:RTS reg_d	is kodas=2 & metod=0 & regai<7 &reg_d {PC=reg_d;pop(reg_d);return [PC];}

:MARK nnn	is kodas=0x34 &nnn {tmp:2=inst_next;SP=tmp+2*nnn;PC=R5;pop(R5);} # SP := PC + 2 * NN; PC := R5; R5 := (SP)+
:SPL reg_dd is kodas=2 & metod=3 & reg_dd {PC=PC; SPLevel=reg_dd;} #set priority level?

########################## HARDWARE "JSR" EMT/TRAP/IOT/BPT & RTI/RTT #####################################
:EMT "[#"baitas"]"				is op_h=0x88 & baitas 				{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:EMT "[#"eemt"] .PRINT"			is op_h=0x88 & baitas=0xE9 & eemt 	{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:EMT "[#"eemt"] .EXIT"			is op_h=0x88 & baitas=0xE8 & eemt 	{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:EMT "[#"eemt"] .TTY_IN"		is op_h=0x88 & baitas=0xE0 & eemt 	{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:EMT "[#"eemt"] .TTY_OUT"		is op_h=0x88 & baitas=0xE1 & eemt 	{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:EMT "[#"eemt"] .I/O page op"	is op_h=0x88 & baitas=0xFD & eemt 	{ push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x18; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x1A; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}

:TRAP "[#"baitas"]"		is op_h=0x89 &baitas	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x1e; PS=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x001c; PC=*tmp; call [PC];}

:IOT		is imm16=0x004	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x10; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x12; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}
:BPT		is imm16=0x003	{push(PS); tmp:2=inst_next; push(tmp); tmp=0x0C; PC=*:2 tmp; tmp=0x0E; PS=*:2 tmp; call [PC];}

:RTI		is imm16=0x002	{pop(PC); pop(PS); return [PC];} # NETEISYBE
:RTT		is imm16=0x006	{pop(PC); pop(PS); return [PC];} # NETEISYBE

###### workspace & multiprocessor

#:MFPI OPDD		is kodas=0x35 ... & OPDD {push(OPDD); N=((OPDD&0x8000)!=0); Z=(OPDD==0); V=0;}	#Move from previous I space: -(SP) <- Src
:MFPD OPDD		is kodas=0x35 ... & OPDD {push(OPDD); N=((OPDD&0x8000)!=0); Z=(OPDD==0); V=0;}	#Move from previous D space: -(SP) <- Src

#:MTPI OPDD		is kodas=0x36 ... & OPDD {tmpv:2=0; pop(tmpv); OPDD=tmpv; N=((tmpv&0x8000)!=0); Z=(tmpv==0); V=0;}		#Move to previous I space: Dest <- (SP)+
:MTPD OPDD		is kodas=0x36 ... & OPDD {tmpv:2=0; pop(tmpv); OPDD=tmpv; N=((tmpv&0x8000)!=0); Z=(tmpv==0); V=0;}		#Move to previous D space: Dest <- (SP)+

:TSTSET OPDD	is kodas=0x3A... & OPDD {tmpv:2=OPDD; N=((tmpv&0x8000)!=0); Z=(tmpv==0); V=0; C=((tmpv&1)!=0); OPDD=1; R0=tmpv;}
:WRTLCK OPDD	is kodas=0x3E... & OPDD {OPDD=R0; N=((R0&0x8000)!=0); Z=(R0==0); V=0;}


######## FPU FPU FPU #########################
define register offset=0x0030 size=2 [ F0 ];
define register offset=0x0032 size=2 [ F1 ];
define register offset=0x0034 size=2 [ F2 ];
define register offset=0x0036 size=2 [ F3 ];
attach variables [ ac ] [ F0 F1 F2 F3 ];




FRD: reg_d is reg_d			{ export *:1 reg_d; }
:FADD FRD	is fpu=0b0111101000000 & FRD {PC=PC;}
:FSUB FRD	is fpu=0b0111101000001 & FRD {PC=PC;}
:FMUL FRD	is fpu=0b0111101000010 & FRD {PC=PC;}
:FDIV FRD	is fpu=0b0111101000011 & FRD {PC=PC;}

############ nezinoma fpu

:ldcfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111111  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:divfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111001  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:cmpfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11110111  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:ldcifd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111110  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:ldexp OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111101  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:ldfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11110101  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:modfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11110011  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:mulfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11110010  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:negfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11000111  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:stcfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111100  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}
:stfd OPD,ac		is (op_h=0b11111000  &ac)... &OPD{PC=PC;}


:ccfc is imm16=0xf000 {PC=PC;}
:setf is imm16=0xf001 {PC=PC;}
:seti is imm16=0xf002 {PC=PC;}

:setd is imm16=0xf009 {PC=PC;}
:setl is imm16=0xf00a {PC=PC;}

:stexp	ac,reg_d	is op_h=0b11111010 &reg_d &ac {PC=PC;}
#:ldexp	reg_d,ac	is op_h=0b11111101 &reg_d &ac {PC=PC;}

######## HALT MODE ############################

#:START ($RUN$) = o10-o13
#:STEP ($STEP$) =o14-o17
#:RSEL ($MFSL$) =o20
#:MFUS ($MFPM$) = o21
#:RCPC ($MFPC$) = o22-o23
#:RCPS ($MFPS$) = o24-o27
#:MTUS ($MTPM$) = o31
#:WCPC ($MTPC$) = o32-o33
#:WCPS ($MTPS$) = o34-o37
#:???? = o30

